    'en': { title: 'Where Subtitle Mojibake Comes From – Spot It, Fix It – AI-SRTSub', desc: 'Mojibake means a wrong read, not a damaged file. Replacement characters, walls of accented letters and runs of obscure characters each point to a cause — learn which recover and which never do.', h1: 'Where subtitle mojibake comes from', intro: 'The same bytes read as UTF-8 and read as GBK come out as two completely different sets of characters. How the garbage text looks is direct evidence of which step went wrong.', ctaText: 'Open the mojibake repair tool' },
